{"2026.5.28:P05-Q09":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>电化学间接除氮废水</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 明德全真模拟 · 原题9 · P05-Q09</div><h1>电化学间接除氮废水</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/电解池</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：联系电极极性、次氯酸氧化和溶液酸度对除氮效率的影响。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/卤素及其化合物/氯气的性质及用途</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：B  11    N  14    O  16    Sn  119</p><p>9. 如图为一种电化学间接处理废水中<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的装置。该装置采用<img src=\"chem-asset:bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252:1;\" style=\"width:94.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阳极材料，以可对溶液pH自适应调节的铝板为阴极材料。电解质溶液为含<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:2;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的废水(含氮350 mg/L)。下列关于该装置的说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:ce75ee125dd0f0d0f7d68ed2cf7a9d87fadb1f870b724cf2df8f32d0c5149ca7:3;\" style=\"width:362.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 电解时a极应与直流电源的正极相连</p><p>B. 电解时b极处理<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:0fb0654b0a1bfeab51f834f70f9320b42acb941d82c795c39a62bf1ba0196803:4;\" style=\"width:260.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 该装置工作时溶液酸性过强，会导致<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">去除效率降低</p><p>D. 每处理1 L废水，a极至少会产生0.84 L气体</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】电化学间接处理废水中<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的装置中，采用<img src=\"chem-asset:bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252:1;\" style=\"width:94.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阳极材料，电极a产生<img src=\"chem-asset:066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec:5;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故电极a为阴极；电极b产生<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:6;\" style=\"width:24.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故为阳极。</p><p>【详解】A．电解时a极为阴极，应与直流电源的负极相连，A错误；</p><p>B．电解时b极处理<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的过程是生成的HClO将废水中的<img src=\"chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:7;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:ad412953ce247a3e42fb706abde7c77ad7913f33fea5acc4773d85a6756d3dbd:8;\" style=\"width:22.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，HClO是弱酸，离子方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:79de19e806c8339309a340d0d433097e329ce0c4600db71c9132aefe6365379b:9;\" style=\"width:285.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:404780d13e99c639824a8bb5322177bbeac9582ea5822014fa4d6a5fa5cced21:10;\" style=\"width:12.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">极产生的氯气会与水发生<img src=\"chem-asset:a4265592b5a6536e54907a70e071e84c4a1fe519f87957733f445a1966fec46b:11;\" style=\"width:205.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，当酸性过强时，<img src=\"chem-asset:f233213d399caee6eecf90a0ee342a9d45c27dabbf4caffe61697641eadcca9a:12;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">上升，导致反应逆移，<img src=\"chem-asset:27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c:13;\" style=\"width:42.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">减少，<img src=\"chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:7;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">去除效率降低，C正确；</p><p>D．选项中未指明气体的状态，无法计算，D错误；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec","0fb0654b0a1bfeab51f834f70f9320b42acb941d82c7